title: "MyHumNews: Reading Myanmar in Burmese"
abstract: "A 134,667-article Burmese news dataset from five outlets, humanitarian and newsroom-topic classifiers, and a cross-lingual retrieval-augmented system that answers English questions from Burmese news with citations."
